sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant UI as React SPA
    participant AB as AuthBootstrap
    participant SB as Supabase Auth
    participant DB as Postgres (user_roles)
    U->>UI: submit email/password
    UI->>SB: signInWithPassword
    SB-->>UI: session (JWT access + refresh)
    SB-->>AB: onAuthStateChange(SIGNED_IN)
    AB->>DB: select role from user_roles where user_id
    DB-->>AB: [admin] | [user] | []
    AB->>UI: dispatch sessionLoaded + rolesLoaded
    UI->>UI: ProtectedRoute / AdminRoute allow render
    Note over UI,DB: All subsequent reads hit PostgREST with JWT;<br/>RLS + has_role() enforce authorization server-side
